{"id": "JAH-FOG-LATOPT-000001", "slug": "fog-latency-optimization", "title": "Latency Optimization \u2014 Overview and definition", "edition": "public", "src": "public-harvest", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "fog data science database record", "ladder_rank": 1, "body": "Public edition. Public fog data science knowledge, fact-checked reference. Measuring, modeling, and minimizing latency across the device-fog-cloud continuum. Latency is the core reason fog exists. Optimization decomposes end-to-end delay into sensing, transmission, queuing, processing, and response legs, then attacks each: processing at the nearest capable node, compressing or filtering before transmission, prioritizing time-critical traffic, caching hot data at the fog tier, and pre-warming models. Typical fog round trips are single-digit milliseconds versus 50-150 ms to a distant cloud region; applications with sub-20 ms budgets (control loops, AR overlays, vehicle safety) effectively require fog placement.", "concepts": ["latency decomposition", "RTT budgeting", "queuing delay", "processing placement", "traffic prioritization", "fog caching", "deadline-aware scheduling", "jitter control", "pre-warming", "latency SLOs"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Overview and concept inventory", "code": "J({topic:__TOPIC__.name,concepts:__TOPIC__.concepts,count:__TOPIC__.concepts.length});assert(__TOPIC__.concepts.length>=5,'concepts');", "verified_output": "{\"topic\":\"Latency Optimization\",\"concepts\":[\"latency decomposition\",\"RTT budgeting\",\"queuing delay\",\"processing placement\",\"traffic prioritization\",\"fog caching\",\"deadline-aware scheduling\",\"jitter control\",\"pre-warming\",\"latency SLOs\"],\"count\":10}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_order": "manons-orders-2026-10-20-database-batch.txt item 89 (fog data science)", "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Latency Optimization Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["fog-computing-architecture", "fog-edge-analytics", "fog-stream-processing", "fog-data-science-master"], "sibling_edition": "fog-latency-optimization-signature"}}
{"id": "JAH-FOG-LATOPT-000002", "slug": "fog-latency-optimization", "title": "Latency Optimization \u2014 Input and output contract", "edition": "public", "src": "public-harvest", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "fog data science database record", "ladder_rank": 3, "body": "Public edition. Public fog data science knowledge, fact-checked reference. Inputs: latency measurements per leg, workload deadlines, network topology, cache hit rates. Outputs: latency budget breakdown, placement recommendation, expected RTT savings.", "concepts": ["latency decomposition", "RTT budgeting", "queuing delay", "processing placement", "traffic prioritization", "fog caching", "deadline-aware scheduling", "jitter control", "pre-warming", "latency SLOs"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Input/output contract validation", "code": "const req={workload_id:'wl-1',fog_node:'fog-1',deadline_ms:20,payload_kb:64};const ok=req.workload_id&&req.fog_node&&req.deadline_ms>0&&req.payload_kb<=1024;J({request:req,valid:!!ok});assert(ok,'contract');", "verified_output": "{\"request\":{\"workload_id\":\"wl-1\",\"fog_node\":\"fog-1\",\"deadline_ms\":20,\"payload_kb\":64},\"valid\":true}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_order": "manons-orders-2026-10-20-database-batch.txt item 89 (fog data science)", "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Latency Optimization Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["fog-computing-architecture", "fog-edge-analytics", "fog-stream-processing", "fog-data-science-master"], "sibling_edition": "fog-latency-optimization-signature"}}
{"id": "JAH-FOG-LATOPT-000003", "slug": "fog-latency-optimization", "title": "Latency Optimization \u2014 Core concepts", "edition": "public", "src": "public-harvest", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "fog data science database record", "ladder_rank": 5, "body": "Public edition. Public fog data science knowledge, fact-checked reference. Core concepts: latency decomposition; RTT budgeting; queuing delay; processing placement; traffic prioritization; fog caching; deadline-aware scheduling; jitter control; pre-warming; latency SLOs.", "concepts": ["latency decomposition", "RTT budgeting", "queuing delay", "processing placement", "traffic prioritization", "fog caching", "deadline-aware scheduling", "jitter control", "pre-warming", "latency SLOs"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Core operation executed", "code": "// core: decompose end-to-end latency and find the dominant leg\nconst legs=[{name:'sense',ms:2},{name:'transmit',ms:5},{name:'queue',ms:4},{name:'process',ms:8},{name:'respond',ms:3}];\nconst total=legs.reduce((a,l)=>a+l.ms,0);const dom=legs.reduce((a,b)=>a.ms>b.ms?a:b);\nconst saved=T.cloud_rtt_ms-total;\nJ({total_ms:total,dominant_leg:dom.name,dominant_ms:dom.ms,cloud_ms:T.cloud_rtt_ms,saved_ms:saved,saving_pct:Math.round(100*saved/T.cloud_rtt_ms)});assert(total<25,'budget');assert(saved>0,'saves');", "verified_output": "{\"total_ms\":22,\"dominant_leg\":\"process\",\"dominant_ms\":8,\"cloud_ms\":95,\"saved_ms\":73,\"saving_pct\":77}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_order": "manons-orders-2026-10-20-database-batch.txt item 89 (fog data science)", "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Latency Optimization Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["fog-computing-architecture", "fog-edge-analytics", "fog-stream-processing", "fog-data-science-master"], "sibling_edition": "fog-latency-optimization-signature"}}
{"id": "JAH-FOG-LATOPT-000004", "slug": "fog-latency-optimization", "title": "Latency Optimization \u2014 Worked example", "edition": "public", "src": "public-harvest", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "fog data science database record", "ladder_rank": 7, "body": "Public edition. Public fog data science knowledge, fact-checked reference. An AR maintenance app moves frame overlays from cloud to a shop-floor fog node: motion-to-photon latency drops from 95 ms to 14 ms, crossing the usability threshold.", "concepts": ["latency decomposition", "RTT budgeting", "queuing delay", "processing placement", "traffic prioritization", "fog caching", "deadline-aware scheduling", "jitter control", "pre-warming", "latency SLOs"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Worked example end to end", "code": "// end-to-end: cache hot data at fog, measure hit-rate effect on latency\nconst requests=1000;let hits=0;for(let i=0;i<requests;i++){const hot=(i*2654435761%100)<70;if(hot)hits++;}\nconst hitRate=hits/requests;const fogMs=8,cloudMs=T.cloud_rtt_ms;const avg=hitRate*fogMs+(1-hitRate)*cloudMs;\nJ({requests,hit_rate:+hitRate.toFixed(3),avg_latency_ms:+avg.toFixed(1),vs_cloud_pct:Math.round(100*(1-avg/cloudMs))});assert(hitRate>0.65&&hitRate<0.75,'hit band');", "verified_output": "{\"requests\":1000,\"hit_rate\":0.7,\"avg_latency_ms\":34.1,\"vs_cloud_pct\":64}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_order": "manons-orders-2026-10-20-database-batch.txt item 89 (fog data science)", "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Latency Optimization Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["fog-computing-architecture", "fog-edge-analytics", "fog-stream-processing", "fog-data-science-master"], "sibling_edition": "fog-latency-optimization-signature"}}
{"id": "JAH-FOG-LATOPT-000005", "slug": "fog-latency-optimization", "title": "Latency Optimization \u2014 Safety, limits, and failure modes", "edition": "public", "src": "public-harvest", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "fog data science database record", "ladder_rank": 9, "body": "Public edition. Public fog data science knowledge, fact-checked reference. Physics sets the floor: distance and speed of light bound propagation delay. Aggressive local caching risks stale data; optimization must trade freshness against latency.", "concepts": ["latency decomposition", "RTT budgeting", "queuing delay", "processing placement", "traffic prioritization", "fog caching", "deadline-aware scheduling", "jitter control", "pre-warming", "latency SLOs"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Safety limits enforced", "code": "const CAP=10n**15n;const request=1000n;const over=CAP+1n;const ok1=request<=CAP;const ok2=over<=CAP;const node={cpu:8,used:7};const job={cpu:4};const fits=node.used+job.cpu<=node.cpu;J({generator_cap:'10^15 (one quadrillion)',request_ok:ok1,over_cap_refused:!ok2,oversized_job_refused:!fits});assert(ok1&&!ok2&&!fits,'limits');", "verified_output": "{\"generator_cap\":\"10^15 (one quadrillion)\",\"request_ok\":true,\"over_cap_refused\":true,\"oversized_job_refused\":true}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_order": "manons-orders-2026-10-20-database-batch.txt item 89 (fog data science)", "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Latency Optimization Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["fog-computing-architecture", "fog-edge-analytics", "fog-stream-processing", "fog-data-science-master"], "sibling_edition": "fog-latency-optimization-signature"}}
{"id": "JAH-FOG-LATOPT-000006", "slug": "fog-latency-optimization", "title": "Latency Optimization \u2014 Beginner teaching exercise", "edition": "public", "src": "public-harvest", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "fog data science database record", "ladder_rank": 2, "body": "Public edition. Public fog data science knowledge, fact-checked reference. Start simple: define the fog computing stack (device, fog, cloud tiers) for Latency Optimization, identify which tier each workload belongs on, and verify with a small latency-budget calculation before scaling up.", "concepts": ["latency decomposition", "RTT budgeting", "queuing delay", "processing placement", "traffic prioritization", "fog caching", "deadline-aware scheduling", "jitter control", "pre-warming", "latency SLOs"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Beginner teaching exercise: cloud vs fog round trip", "code": "const fog=T.nodes[0].rtt_ms;const cloud=T.cloud_rtt_ms;const saved=cloud-fog;const pct=Math.round(100*saved/cloud);J({fog_rtt_ms:fog,cloud_rtt_ms:cloud,saved_ms:saved,saving_pct:pct});assert(saved>0,'saves');assert(pct>50,'big win');", "verified_output": "{\"fog_rtt_ms\":6,\"cloud_rtt_ms\":95,\"saved_ms\":89,\"saving_pct\":94}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_order": "manons-orders-2026-10-20-database-batch.txt item 89 (fog data science)", "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Latency Optimization Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["fog-computing-architecture", "fog-edge-analytics", "fog-stream-processing", "fog-data-science-master"], "sibling_edition": "fog-latency-optimization-signature"}}
{"id": "JAH-FOG-LATOPT-000007", "slug": "fog-latency-optimization", "title": "Latency Optimization \u2014 Advanced pattern", "edition": "public", "src": "public-harvest", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "fog data science database record", "ladder_rank": 11, "body": "Public edition. Public fog data science knowledge, fact-checked reference. Advanced use of Latency Optimization combines neighboring topics: feed its outputs into the next tier, add verification checkpoints at each handoff, and automate the pipeline once the manual path is proven.", "concepts": ["latency decomposition", "RTT budgeting", "queuing delay", "processing placement", "traffic prioritization", "fog caching", "deadline-aware scheduling", "jitter control", "pre-warming", "latency SLOs"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Advanced pattern: weighted failover across fog nodes", "code": "const nodes=T.nodes.map(n=>({...n,load:0}));let dropped=0;for(let i=0;i<40;i++){const live=nodes.filter(n=>n.load<n.cpu*10);if(!live.length){dropped++;continue;}const n=live.reduce((a,b)=>(a.load/a.cpu)<=(b.load/b.cpu)?a:b);n.load++;}const loads=nodes.map(n=>n.load);const over=nodes.filter(n=>n.load>n.cpu*10);const shares=nodes.map(n=>({id:n.id,share:+(n.load/n.cpu).toFixed(2)}));J({assigned:40-dropped,dropped,loads,shares,over_capacity:over.length});assert(dropped===0,'no drops');assert(over.length===0,'capacity');", "verified_output": "{\"assigned\":40,\"dropped\":0,\"loads\":[27,13],\"shares\":[{\"id\":\"fog-1\",\"share\":3.38},{\"id\":\"fog-2\",\"share\":3.25}],\"over_capacity\":0}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_order": "manons-orders-2026-10-20-database-batch.txt item 89 (fog data science)", "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Latency Optimization Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["fog-computing-architecture", "fog-edge-analytics", "fog-stream-processing", "fog-data-science-master"], "sibling_edition": "fog-latency-optimization-signature"}}
